1
00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:21.420
As expected of Cassie, she's got such a well-trained night order and such a powerful squad of mages.

2
00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:24.620
Where the hell is that washed up old hack?

3
00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:28.500
Don't tell me she took a look at my lineup and ran away scared.

4
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:45.930
Bored proper swords!

5
00:00:45.930 --> 00:00:50.250
So you're sending your troops into battle carrying a bunch of scrap metal pipes?

6
00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:55.050
One charge for my knights, one fireball for my mages and you're done.

7
00:00:55.050 --> 00:00:58.490
I'll give you one last chance.

8
00:00:58.490 --> 00:01:11.180
Get off your horse, crawl over here, lick my boots and beg for mercy.

9
00:01:11.180 --> 00:01:14.100
Welcome to the age of firearms, sweetheart.
